{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fill Up The Hole is a game where you help peons create as much garbage as possible and toss it into a hole. Watch your village grow and evolve as you unlock visual upgrades and new features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In the Demo</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play the first few earthquakes. Most quests\\achievements aren't available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Throw Garbage</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your peons will automatically gather garbage and toss it into the hole. The more they throw, the bigger your progress!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630390/extras/peon_throw_small.gif?t=1745414691\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Create a Village</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expand your village to maximize the amount of garbage produced and thrown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630390/extras/city_small.gif?t=1745414691\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upgrade</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock upgrades and abilities to enhance your buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630390/extras/upgrade_small.gif?t=1745414691\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiple Strategies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Expand your base by taking time removing rocks. <br>- Create and upgrade different buildings. <br>- The order of the building can make the difference. <br>- Enhance the abilities of the peons. <br>- Gain new research, talents and skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630390/extras/bull_small.gif?t=1745414691\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3630390?t=1745414691","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630390/1bc9607d3d88789644e3b8dd9584e9788eb4c3d0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745414691","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630390/5e8615b3b0bf88ee8ef9feffb87f24c2c1aa837c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745414691","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630390/5e8615b3b0bf88ee8ef9feffb87f24c2c1aa837c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745414691","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fill Up The Hole is a game where you help peons create as much garbage as possible and toss it into a hole. Watch your village grow and evolve as you unlock visual upgrades and new features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In the Demo</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play the first few earthquakes. Most quests\\achievements aren't available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Throw Garbage</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your peons will automatically gather garbage and toss it into the hole. The more they throw, the bigger your progress!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630390/extras/peon_throw_small.gif?t=1745414691\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Create a Village</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expand your village to maximize the amount of garbage produced and thrown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item